Research Item 003

Source Type:
Industry Research

Source:
Baymard Institute

Topic:
Dashboard Orientation

Observation:
Users need contextual information and guidance to understand available account-related features and navigate effectively.

Translation to License Management:
A license landing page should help users understand:
- What software they own
- What is active
- What needs attention

Before exposing complex management tools.

Key takeaway:
License dashboards should prioritize orientation and understanding before task execution.

Confidence:
Medium

Source:
https://baymard.com/guidelines/3054-the-account-dashboard-page

