# Competitive Benchmark 
Research Item 004

Source Type:
Competitive Benchmark

Source:
Adobe Admin Console

Topic:
Portfolio Visibility

Observation:
Adobe surfaces assigned licenses, available licenses, and utilization information through a top-level Overview dashboard.

Translation to License Management:
Users should first see:
- Total Licenses
- Assigned
- Available
- Needs Attention

Before reviewing individual licenses.

Key takeaway:
Provide portfolio-level visibility before license-level visibility.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://helpx.adobe.com/business/enterprise/setup-onboarding/explore-adobe-admin-console/adobe-admin-console-overview.html
https://experienceleague.adobe.com/en/docs/support-resources/adobe-support-tools-guide/adobe-admin-console/admin-console-overview

