Research Item 005

Source Type:
Competitive Benchmark

Source:
Microsoft 365 Admin Center

Topic:
Management Paths

Observation:
Microsoft supports both user-centric and product-centric license management workflows.

Translation to License Management:
Customers approach licenses from different mental models:

Path A:
Manage a Product

Path B:
Manage a User

Both paths should be supported.

Key takeaway:
Support both user-centric and product-centric license management journeys.

Confidence:
High

Sources:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/admin/manage/assign-licenses-to-users
